{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/making_screen_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T00:26:47.046739Z","id":"665bec2397203bd0754662012fd521ab9f10853618c73e215d51a277b455dd85","body":{"detail":"MakingLog._progress keeps html when a PartialFile is shorter than what is shown (lib/ui/making_screen.dart:201-206). The shots test streams PartialFile('index.html', 'early') then 'mid' with no step between, so target/flutter-app/u1/making-3-mid-*.png repeat page-early-*.png and the mid page is never rendered.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":142},"end":{"line":144},"content_hash":"a777b128b5396175b57b5172cd63cf68fd48c35e62babb0b192a5698eec6b900"},"suggested_fix":"Key the fake frames by texts that grow (for example 'early' and 'middle').","summary":"The '3-mid' render shows the early frame: the fake text 'mid' is shorter than 'early', so MakingLog holds it as a shrink","tags":["review","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/launcher_icons_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:38:13.492042Z","id":"a9e388ee04978030f1981da6b40d2e3170ba581bb30a3e339b0ac06c9ca0c267","body":{"detail":"flutter_test sets debugDisableShadows = true, and RenderPhysicalShape then strokes each elevated shape in black at elevation * 2 (flutter/lib/src/rendering/proxy_box.dart:2216-2224 in the installed SDK). The extended FAB's elevation 6 becomes a 12 px black ring in launcher-*.png, which reads as a focus highlight at rest. The real app draws a shadow there; lib/ui/launcher.dart:506 sets no focus or autofocus on the FAB.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":53},"end":{"line":92},"content_hash":"4f8de258ae501318a6d5559b449e360ee45ea6ea7d0753b70d626c34d4e8e45e"},"suggested_fix":"Set debugDisableShadows = false at the start of each shot (and restore it in addTearDown) so the PNGs show what a person sees.","summary":"The shots render the New app button with a thick black outline because flutter_test disables shadows; turn shadows on for the shots","tags":["test","x4","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/launcher_icons_shots_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:45:39.060629Z","id":"53fa249b3090316c6a29df91631aaae3d6acacdea58df9ed5f3d9dd8e984ec8c","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:f1c07f346b12","summary":"Shots set debugDisableShadows = false; CLAX_X4_SHOTS=1 flutter test --update-goldens test/ui/launcher_icons_shots_test.dart: +4 all passed, New app renders with its elevation shadow","supersedes":"a9e388ee04978030f1981da6b40d2e3170ba581bb30a3e339b0ac06c9ca0c267","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/share_sheet_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:15:20.421926Z","id":"5969081e879cf2edc9a20d3eb14eb777f67d9ddd79ed10bd896005c9d3342912","body":{"detail":"Mutations that left //apps/clax_app:ui_share_sheet_test, ui_launcher_test, ui_remote_flows_test and ui_remote_card_test passing: (1) deleting `if (_busy) return false;` in _act (apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/share_sheet.dart:275), so two Add taps in one frame, or Enter plus Add, send two changes and two re-reads; (2) dropping `|| general == 'public'` from the generals filter (share_sheet.dart:457), so a copy already Public on a remote with no public gallery shows Public as its label but the menu no longer offers it; (3) changing `share = link != null && link.isAuthor` to `share = link != null` in HomeFlows.menu (apps/clax_app/lib/ui/launcher.dart:1332), so a recipient's device offers Share… (the entry-points tests in share_sheet_test.dart:442-493 check only an unlinked app and the author's).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":137},"end":{"line":199},"content_hash":"ef2e50878076954804480c15eaa24dfb92a951be4ffc912e33199261094be220"},"suggested_fix":"Add widget tests: a double tap on Add calls share once; a Public copy without public_gallery lists Public; a recipient link's long-press menu has no Share….","summary":"The Share sheet's single-flight guard, Public-while-already-public and the launcher's recipient gate are not pinned by a test","tags":["review","tests","sharing","app-push-pull","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/share_sheet_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:24:21.174903Z","id":"7e5b7505abe8db998686abbc94ffc2633041a9e89f0a7321af1f8972533a6536","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:e42bf0895","summary":"Each of the three mutations now fails a test (target/t11b-mut2.log): no _busy guard fails 'two taps on Add in one frame send one change'; no || general == 'public' fails 'a copy already Public keeps Public among the choices with no public gallery'; share = link != null in launcher.dart fails 'entry points Share… is in the menu of a linked app' (recipient half). All pass as committed: just test-affected 89edc6a8d -> 90 tests pass.","supersedes":"5969081e879cf2edc9a20d3eb14eb777f67d9ddd79ed10bd896005c9d3342912","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/bundle_flows_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T06:32:10.460699Z","id":"0c8adccfdb4ccd40673207fbf5c1c96c0c6a4272b1162b688fb43e510bd806f2","body":{"detail":"settle(tester) here (20 rounds of runAsync(Future.delayed(Duration.zero)) and a 50 ms pump), the copy in apps/clax_app/test/ui/remote_flows_test.dart (settle, end of file) and apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_clock.dart settle() (50 zero-delay turns, also run inside FakeClock.advance) all stand a pump or turn count in for the services' real file IO, crypto and core calls. Under parallel Bazel load the count runs out first: record d4723a3a saw remote_publisher_test 'a pending bundle survives Disconnect…' and ui_remote_flows_test 'after Disconnect, Publish signs in again…' fail and pass alone. Every test that imports settle from here (app_remote, app_bundles, publish_sheet, share_sheet, bundle_entry_points, remote_card) has the same exposure.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":406},"end":{"line":412},"content_hash":"e0e020061c2983cdb0946a892007548e66dca0b583f64ef7e618afbfcd3fd421"},"suggested_fix":"Make settle wait on a condition the test names (the widget or state it expects next), turning the event loop and pumping until it holds, with a generous timeout that only fails a stuck test.","summary":"settle() waits a fixed count of turns for real IO, so tests that share it fail under parallel load","tags":["flaky","test","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/ui/bundle_flows_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T15:12:07.171556Z","id":"25141def0bc1d7ca630b3642b2ce89509e23ae0f9c64dcf8b67fa122c39e4357","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:6dd17eea6e948a527caa3f3a87c5ba69383d0312","summary":"Fixed in 6dd17eea6: apps/clax_app/test/support/settle.dart settle(tester, finder)/settleUntil(tester, condition)/waitUntil(condition) wait on the condition each test names (2-minute stuck timeout), replacing the turn-counted settle in test/ui/bundle_flows_test.dart, test/ui/remote_flows_test.dart and the settle() calls of test/remote/publisher_test.dart, and every caller (app_remote, app_bundles, publish_sheet, share_sheet, bundle_entry_points, remote_card). Load runs: bazelisk test of ui_remote_flows_test, remote_publisher_test, ui_bundle_flows_test, app_remote_test, app_bundles_test, ui_publish_sheet_test, ui_share_sheet_test, ui_bundle_entry_points_test, ui_remote_card_test, queue_render_bridge_test, remote_checker_test with --runs_per_test=10 --local_test_jobs=8 --nocache_test_results: before (at 23cae4064) 'Executed 11 out of 11 tests: 10 tests pass and 1 fails locally', //apps/clax_app:ui_remote_flows_test 'FAILED in 1 out of 10' ('after Disconnect, Publish signs in again...': Bad state: No element at tapVisible, remote_flows_test.dart:172); after (at 6dd17eea6) 'Executed 11 out of 11 tests: 11 tests pass', all 110 runs passing.","supersedes":"0c8adccfdb4ccd40673207fbf5c1c96c0c6a4272b1162b688fb43e510bd806f2","tags":["session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
